<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">Engungwel</book>
  <para style="h">YUDE</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ɔ̃nkaan a Yude</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yude</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yud</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ɔ̃nkaan wa Yude</para>
  <para style="imt1">Obɛɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan</para>
  <para style="ip">Onse Ondoo b'Alili, ayɛɛn me baal nsiaan b'ali me nkuũ yi Yude, kɛn a Yude wu áswɛn ɔ̃nkaan wu, wu oli ɔ̃sal a Yeso Mãsia bvool oli muaan-ngoo a Dzak (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JUD 1:1">1.1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:55">Mat 13.55</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:3">Mak 6.3</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbuul wu atsio ɔ̃nkaan a Yude ngesɛ, amwɛn kwɛn ɔ̃nkaan ondɛ ayi nkuul mɔ̃ ye wa Piɛɛl wa mviaal m'ãndɔɔ bibi. Ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ ãli ãnkunkwa m'áwi akiool me ndɔɔ atee a mfya (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JUD 1:6-13">6-13</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:1-3">2Pi 2.1-3</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">Otsɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan a Yude oli b'awa akilisito ãnkunkwa me ndɔɔ a «baal b'abi b'abewal nyiĩ a Nziã a bia-byɛ onge mpwee yi asa ãndɔɔ m'opfuru, bvool me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ ebee Yeso Mãsia (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JUD 1:3-4">3-4</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">Yude aliaal ãndɔɔ m'ãsuo emfa ki ekieel etsiil Nziã ãndɔɔ ã baal m'emfa ki ɔ̃yɛɛl a ndɛ wu obvuul (onge bviil li Sodome ye li Gomɔɔl, bvool ye b'ásam onse tsuunga wu ébvool Kole <char style="xt"><ref loc="JUD 1:5-16">5-16</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">Yude bvool atam andoo a dzii k'ayeel ãndɔɔ m'élieel antam a Mfam Yeso Mãsia tsɔɔn (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JUD 1:17-20">17-20</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">Ke mbee a ŋ'eyɛɛn Yude me ndɔɔ otsiil b'ãndɔɔ, ndɛ asɔɔ kwɛn baal asuo dzii ola b'ali onse odziɔɔn (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JUD 1:22-23">22-23</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">Ɔ̃nkaan a Yude osɛn m'ebuɛɛn li ngesɛ me ndɔɔ lweel e Nziã (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JUD 1:25">25</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃bio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />Mɛ̃, wu Yude wu ɔ̃sal a Yeso Mãsia bvool wu muaan-ngoo a Dzak, nswɛn byɛ b'éti Nziã wu Taal mbel. Ndɛ odzii byɛ bvool abekiaal byɛ me nkuul a Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="JUD 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã ayoo byɛ ãwua, awa byɛ hɛ̃ opi ye dzii bam ngamfɛn.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Andoo a mɛ̃ a dzii, mɛ̃ éli y'efua bibi ki eswɛn byɛ ɔ̃nkaan, me ndɔɔ yi etal obvuul b'oli eluɔ e bia-byɛ ki bvoo. Kɛn a mɛ̃ mwɛn kwɛn ebvaan mɛ̃ nsa yɔ meba me ndɔɔ yi ewa byɛ mpɛn yi edzwaan me ndɔɔ okiool b'éwi Nziã ba ngel ɔ̃bu. <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />Mɛ̃ nswɛn byɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn baal bakyɛ amaasuɛɛn onse byɛ. Bɔ b'abi obɔ abewal nyiĩ a Nziã a bia-byɛ onge mpwee yi asa ãndɔɔ m'opfuru, bvool bɔ abebee Yeso Mãsia. Ɔ̃tee ye Mfam a bia-byɛ eli kɛn a ndyam. Etel-nziil, Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã ámayɛɛn me ndɔɔ etumbu e bɔ.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />Byɛ b'eyɛɛ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ mam mbueel, mɛ̃ nzii k'eyeel byɛ wɛn, Mfam ábvuul yam e ndɛ k'Edzipito, ke mbee oŋɔ̃ ndɛ átam k'abweel b'ábee k'akiool. <verse eid="JUD 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />Ãnzwel mɛn k'ã́dzii k'ãsɛn ke mboo yi ésuul Nziã mɔ̃ wɛ, bvool ã́yiri ãmboo ã bɔ m'ɔ̃sal, ndɛ okwee mɔ̃ ɔ̃bu m'ãmpaa onse lempeel, me ndɔɔ a tsoo li nɛn li ètsiil ndɛ ãndɔɔ. <verse eid="JUD 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />Eli emfa kiki, me bviil li Sodom ye li Gomɔɔl y'ãbviil mã nku-a-nku a mɔ̃: Baal a mɔ̃ ákal onse ãndɔɔ m'esio emfa ngemɔ̃ onge ãnzwel omɔ̃, bvool ábvool ntal m'emfa kyɛn k'abebvool wɛ. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn bɔ abɔɔ etumbu ki mbaa yi ɔ̃bu. Ndɔɔ oyɔ eli ãnkunkwa m'awi baal bueel. <verse eid="JUD 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Emfa kiki hɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a baal obɔ: Ãtsam ã bɔ ãtam bɔ k'abiil ãnzuru ã bɔ. Bɔ abefiɛɛn Omfam o Nziã, bvool abetoo ãnzwel mã ye lweel. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" />Onkyam Miswel wu mfam a ãnzwel k'ási obobɔ wɛ. Ŋ'éketsuun ndɛ y'ɔ̃pfu me ndɔɔ ebiĩ Moyize, ndɛ k'ámbio k'atoo ndɛ me ndɔɔ yi awa ndɛ etumbu wɛ. Ndɛ álieel kɛn a ndɛ ndiri: «Yɔɔl kwɛn Mfam awa yɛ etumbu!» <verse eid="JUD 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Kɛn a bɔ abesiaan ãndɔɔ mɛn bɔ k'ayɛɛ wɛ, ye m'eyɛɛ bɔ kɛn a m'emfa ki ombuul onge anyam b'aywɛn a ãyal. Omɔ̃ ãndɔɔ m'ãbiil bɔ. <verse eid="JUD 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />Ãwua ã bɔ! Ke ngwel wɛ, bɔ anɔɔn nkuul a Kayiin, bɔ asam onse pfuru me nzal a nzi onge Balam<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:1-35">Ɛ̃bv 16.1-35</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 22:1-35">22.1-35</ref></char></note>, bɔ akwi me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ abee k'alweel Nziã onge Kole. <verse eid="JUD 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Bɔ abebiil ãpfuun m'ondoo mã baan a Nziã m'ebebɛɛl byɛ. Bɔ abedza bvool abenywã bam bibi, opfuru pyɛ, atsam kɛn a me bam. Bɔ ali onge epɛn bvɛn mfel abebiri, bvɛn k'esuul mvel andwɔɔ wɛ. Bɔ ali onge ɛ̃ti myɛn k'ɛ̃buru nsia wɛ, me lio li aka yɔ, ɛ̃ti mi amaayiob bvool mi ɛ̃mɛɛ̃kwa nsa yuaal. <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />Bɔ ali onge epoo e mpuru bvi nzal. Bɔ abepaal ãndɔɔ m'opfuru onge b'ebepaal epoo ãfel. Bɔ ali bvool onge angam-a-ngam b'abekɛɛn abekɛɛn. Nziã ámaayɛɛl bɔ lempeel li kokɔ li ɔ̃bu. <verse eid="JUD 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />Eli hɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a bɔ k'élieel Henok wu ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃nkiɛɛn a Nziã wa nsiaan, ŋ'abɛɛn m'Ãdam, ndiri: «Etal, Mfam ayeya y'anzwel ã ndɛ mã ngel amiil bibi, <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />me ndɔɔ yi atsiil ãndɔɔ ã baal bueel. Ndɛ àwa baal b'ãbi bueel etumbu, m'ãndɔɔ mbueel m'ãbi m'ési bɔ ndɛ. Ndɛ àwa anga-ãbi etumbu me ndɔɔ ɛ̃tswɛ mi éswel éswel bɔ ndɛ.» <verse eid="JUD 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />Baal obɔ k'abekal y'esɛ wɛ, abekal onse ɛ̃nduɔɔl, bvool bɔ abenɔɔn efua e bɔ bvi ebi-ebi. Bɔ abeyɛɛn ãndɔɔ mã nzal-a-nsia, bvool bɔ abeyɛɛn baal ãyɛɛn mã y'opɛɛn, kwɛn asa bɔ obvɛ.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Luo me ndɔɔ akiool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Me b'otal byɛ, andoo a dzii, eyeel ãndɔɔ m'élieel antam a Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia tsɔɔn. <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" />Bɔ álieel byɛ bubu: «Me lio li ntɔ, ekieel ekal ye baal b'àsyob byɛ bvool ànɔɔn efua e bam bvi ebi-ebi, lweel e Nziã pyɛ.» <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />Bɔ obɔ baal b'abetsal akiool, b'abekal m'emfa ki ombuul, bvool bɛn k'ali y'Ɔ̃fel wɛ. <verse eid="JUD 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />Kɛn a byɛ, andoo a mɛ̃ a dzi, enɔɔn k'etuu omwiĩ o byɛ nkal okiool o byɛ bo ngel. Ebuɛɛn m'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal. <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />Ekal onse dzii e Nziã, ŋ'ebekiaal byɛ kwɛn Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia, m'ãwua ã ndɛ, awa byɛ elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu. <verse eid="JUD 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Ekal ye nyiĩ a baal b'ali kɛn onse enkyam. <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />Ebvuul bɔ m'opaal o bɔ onse mbaa. Me b'otal bakyɛ bvool, eyoo bɔ ãwua ye buɔ bueel. Kɛn ebee me bɔ onywɛn, onkyam m'ekɔ e bɔ bvi emeebii m'efua e bɔ bvi ebi-ebi bvi ombuul.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Olweel o Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Ola Nziã wu okoo k'akiaal byɛ kwɛn byɛ ebee obva, bvool asuul byɛ epal elyal pyɛ ke nkwel a lweel e ndɛ, onse esɛ, <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />ola ndɛ wu oli kɛn a ngɔmɔ̃, wu obvuul bia-byɛ me nkuul a Yeso Mãsia wu Mfam a bia-byɛ, yɔɔl kwɛn lweel, omfam, waan, y'okwɛn, okal bo ndɛ, fa ãlio mbueel, meba tiil ɔ̃bu nkal-ɔ̃bu! Amɛn!<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>